# {{ project_name }}

Multi-tenant Django project built on [tripaulx-sdk](https://github.com/tripaulx/tripaulx-builder-init).
Each workspace has its own PostgreSQL schema and is served at
`<slug>.{{ base_domain }}`.

## Run locally

Requirements: [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/) and PostgreSQL 16 (Homebrew).

```bash
./start          # creates .env.local and the database, migrates, runs :8000
./start test     # test-suite
```

- Public schema: http://{{ local_base_domain }}:8000/admin/
- First workspace: http://{{ initial_workspace | replace('_', '-') }}.{{ local_base_domain }}:8000/admin/

Create an admin inside a workspace:

```bash
uv run python manage.py create_tenant_superuser --schema {{ initial_workspace }}
```

## Layout

| Path | What |
|---|---|
| `config/settings/base_parts/` | settings chunks (never edit `base.py`) |
| `config/settings/{local,prod,test}.py` | per-environment settings |
| `config/urls.py` / `urls_public.py` | workspace / public-schema routes |
| `users/` | concrete `User` (inherits `AbstractTripaulxUser`) |

## Update from the template

```bash
uvx copier update --trust
```
